{"id": "42", "title": "坟", "author": "鲁迅", "category": "文学名著", "count": 24, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/0/42.htm", "intro": "鲁迅杂文集<坟>《坟》杂文集，作者鲁迅。写于1907年——1925年间，鲁迅之所以要出版这些旧文，是因为“有人憎恶着”；同时也作为生活一部分的痕迹收敛起来，“造成一座小小的新坟，一面是埋藏，一面是留恋”。", "base": "files/article/html/0/42", "chapters": [{"title": "题记", "file": "2667.html", "available": false}, {"title": "科学史教篇", "file": "2668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "摩罗诗力说", "file": "2669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宋民间之所谓小说及其后来", "file": "2670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "文化偏至论", "file": "2671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "说胡须", "file": "2672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我们怎样做父亲⑴", "file": "2673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "论“费厄泼赖”应该缓行", "file": "2674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "未有天才之前", "file": "2675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "坚壁清野主义", "file": "2676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我之节烈观", "file": "2677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "寡妇主义", "file": "2678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "春末闲谈", "file": "2679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "论雷峰塔的倒掉", "file": "2680.html", "available": false}, {"title": "再论雷峰塔的倒掉", "file": "2681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "看镜有感", "file": "2682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "杂忆", "file": "2683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "娜拉走后怎样", "file": "2684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "论睁了眼看", "file": "2685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "论照相之类", "file": "2686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "写在《坟》后面", "file": "2687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "论“他妈的！”", "file": "2688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "从胡须说到牙齿", "file": "2689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "灯下漫笔", "file": "2690.html", "available": false}]}